# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# Mustfile — Physical state contract
# Author: Jonathan D.A. Jewell <j.d.a.jewell@open.ac.uk>

@abstract:
What MUST be true about this repository's files and configuration.
These are hard requirements — CI fails if any check fails.
@end

## File Presence

### license-present
- description: LICENSE file must exist
- run: test -f LICENSE
- severity: critical

### readme-present
- description: README.adoc or README.md must exist
- run: test -f README.adoc || test -f README.md
- severity: critical

### security-policy
- description: SECURITY.md must exist
- run: test -f SECURITY.md
- severity: critical

### ai-manifest
- description: 0-AI-MANIFEST.a2ml must exist
- run: test -f 0-AI-MANIFEST.a2ml
- severity: critical

### contributing
- description: CONTRIBUTING.adoc or CONTRIBUTING.md must exist (GitHub community health)
- run: test -f CONTRIBUTING.adoc || test -f CONTRIBUTING.md
- severity: warning

### editorconfig
- description: .editorconfig must exist
- run: test -f .editorconfig
- severity: warning

## SPDX Compliance

### spdx-headers
- description: All source files must have SPDX-License-Identifier
- run: "! find src/ core/ -name '*.rs' -o -name '*.ml' -o -name '*.mll' -o -name '*.mly' 2>/dev/null | head -20 | xargs grep -L 'SPDX-License-Identifier' 2>/dev/null | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: warning

### no-agpl
- description: No AGPL-3.0 references in dotfiles
- run: "! grep -r 'AGPL-3.0' .gitignore .gitattributes .editorconfig 2>/dev/null | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: critical

## Banned Languages (Hyperpolymath Standard)

### no-typescript-sources
- description: No TypeScript source files (use AffineScript)
- run: "! find . -name '*.ts' -o -name '*.tsx' 2>/dev/null | grep -v node_modules | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: critical

### no-node-manifests
- description: No package.json runtime manifests (use Deno / deno.json)
- run: "! find . -name 'package.json' 2>/dev/null | grep -v node_modules | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: warning

## Dangerous Patterns

### no-believe-me
- description: No believe_me in proof / Idris2 code
- run: "! grep -rE 'believe_me' --include='*.idr' . 2>/dev/null | grep -v node_modules | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: critical

### no-assert-total
- description: No assert_total escape hatch in proof code
- run: "! grep -rE 'assert_total' --include='*.idr' . 2>/dev/null | grep -v node_modules | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: critical

### no-sorry
- description: No sorry in Lean / Isabelle proof code
- run: "! grep -rE 'sorry' --include='*.lean' --include='*.thy' . 2>/dev/null | grep -v node_modules | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: critical

### no-admitted
- description: No Admitted in Coq / Agda proof code
- run: "! grep -rE 'Admitted' --include='*.v' --include='*.agda' . 2>/dev/null | grep -v node_modules | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: critical

### no-obj-magic
- description: No Obj.magic escape hatch in the OCaml reference core
- run: "! grep -rE 'Obj\\.magic' --include='*.ml' --include='*.mli' . 2>/dev/null | grep -v node_modules | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: critical

### no-unsafe-without-comment
- description: All unsafe blocks in Rust must have SAFETY comments
- run: "! grep -B1 'unsafe {' --include='*.rs' -r . 2>/dev/null | grep -v SAFETY | grep 'unsafe {' | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: warning
